                        "review": "My 2.5 year old daughter is in love with it, with the scaling options in the game she can play it just fine and this is the only game so far that can be adjusted to fit her height.\n\nOf course she cannot complete the game but she has so much fun shooting the ginger bread men and she loves how they cry when they get hit!\n\nMe and my wife also play this game a lot and we both completed the game on the hard setting and still come back to it to compete to get the best score.\n\nOur most played game in our VR library so far!",
